OL,3,GNEWSAThree injured after shotgun fired
OL,4,Ain town centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been injured and a
OL,7,Fteenage boy has been arrested after a
OL,8,Fshotgun was fired in a town centre,
OL,9,Fpolice said.
OL,11,FEssex Police was called to an incident
OL,12,Fin Market Place, Braintree, at about
OL,13,F22:10 BST on Monday.
OL,15,FTwo teenage boys sustained potentially
OL,16,Fserious, but not life-threatening,
OL,17,Ffacial injuries after the shooting
OL,18,Finvolving two groups, the force said.
OL,20,FA 16-year-old boy was arrested in
OL,21,Fconnection with the shooting and
OL,22,Fremains in custody, police added.
